        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The Promise of Tutoring for PreK–12 Learning: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of the Experimental Evidence",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Nickow, Oreopoulos and Quan (2024) present the journal version of their systematic review and meta-analysis of tutoring field experiments. The American Educational Research Journal article reports a pooled effect of 0.288 standard deviations (SE 0.029) and examines variation by tutor type, grade, frequency and setting.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "7cb59354e30c48119e99ff62fcf61646"
