  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "25f0ec3189e4427cbdb294d2016b692d"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The 2024 tutoring meta-analysis estimated a pooled learning gain of 0.288 standard deviations.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Nickow, Oreopoulos and Quan (2024) report an overall pooled effect size of 0.288 standard deviations (SE 0.029, p < .001) across tutoring field experiments. Effects tend to be largest with teachers or paraprofessionals, earlier grades, at least three days per week and during school; the pooled estimate does not describe every implementation.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "da4a6c1f9d4446f9832ff3b49a4400ef"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "value": true
        }
